    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Strikes from these wraps leave wounds that refuse to knit, rotting the flesh with a caustic bite. Held by the chosen of the Helm, the iron plates have tasted the marrow of many foes. Such strength of blow is unrivaled in all the world."
